<title>JAPAN: Nippon Electric -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nippon Electric -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 13.04		vs	   11.56</p>
<p> Operating   loss 693    million	  vs     loss 1.01</p>
<p> Current     loss 728    million	  vs     loss 1.12</p>
<p> Net	   loss 870    million	  vs     loss 1.11</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 17.40 yen	  vs    loss 27.70 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     50 million	  vs	  40 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  0.00 yen	  vs	    0.00 yen</p>
